- Record entry-document observations when no triggered retrieve governs the read.
- Record every unestablished non-strict DPP read, including one whose child has a local writer.
- Keep these DPP observations out of strict `unestablished_reads`. They are conditional reads, not unconditional entry requirements.
- Preserve immediate in-process diagnostics through the existing predicates.
